// SegmentedTabs (ds-metrics §17 — accentPill / flatPill): 48pt track, inset 4, gap 4, radius 24 (no token), bg2.
// Segments are `Segment` children the screen repeats, owning the selection — template events carry no payload, so a
// tabs template could not report which index was tapped:
//   {"type": "SegmentedTabs", "id": "tabs", "children": [{"type": "Segment", "id": "tab", "repeat": {"over": "tabs"},
//     "props": {"title": "=item", "selected": "=tab == index"}, "on": {"tap": "tab = index"}}]}
